# The same, as under the BOINC client: the library's timer signal (10 Hz) ends every sleep and poll early, and the monitor's
# loops start the wait again with the time left (docs/kb/shared/boinc-api.md, YAR-003). The wake-ups of the timer itself are
# a floor that no change to the monitor can lower; this profile shows how much of the total the monitor's own waits are.
source yarrow
interval 600
hours 72
cpm 20
seed 1
sigalrm 10
